        "Eligibility for Membership",
        "Article 7 Any adult man or woman of sound mind may become a member of this organization, provided that he or she: 1. Accepts the objectives and goals of the organization as the objectives and goals of his or her own life. 2. Properly performs all obligatory (Fard) and compulsory (Wajib) duties prescribed by Shariah and refrains from all major sins (Kabair). 3. Does not adopt any means of earning that constitutes disobedience to Allah Almighty, and abandons any wealth acquired through unlawful (Haram) means or through the violation of another person's rights, or returns such rights to their rightful owners. 4. Properly observes the discipline of the organization and gives priority to the interests of the organization over personal interests. 5. Does not maintain affiliation with any institution or organization whose principles, objectives, goals, or policies are contrary to the Islamic faith (Iman and Aqidah) or to the objectives, goals, and policies of the Korea Muslim Community. 6. Is considered qualified for membership by the responsible authorities of the Korea Muslim Community.",
